9ApXSjH897l691Carn-0K56ZtJZ8-I6AiyDRgNjQlpiOHi0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVZqXsHlnUg5LMRPT9BLPAAE1XX2c0hPCGKY1d1_L6_Hg&oe=6B103F2C"}, {"file_name": "image_005_0000.png", "id": "1020699260107858", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391837_1020699263441191_2298371123509554043_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5F6kM8rr904Q7kNvwFGgLFK&_nc_oc=Adpeb8BrbS7jjJ-m6qb3JmOeGR5V-gyfWWLxE8_w5zKTO5bsZWgDFX5ivrLGvhOesN8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXqVK9zzsL0e3CO724mXoX5ONAH_hmszXu-8-g6PImflQ&oe=6B103CB4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Enter Emotions", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The **Enter Emotions** application is an innovative tool that supports emotional intelligence development through immersive experiences. It consists of several key modules that together help users better recognize, understand, and regulate emotions. Each element of the application plays an important role in the process of emotional learning and training.\n\n## Key elements of the application:\n##\n1. **Animations**  \nThey serve as an introduction to the world of emotions. Visualizations help better understand the mechanisms of emotions, their impact on thinking and behavior. Through realistic scenes, users can observe various social situations, analyze characters' emotions, and learn how to respond to them appropriately.\n##\n2. **Relaxation Scene**  \nIt is the foundation preparing users for further emotional work. It creates a calm, immersive environment where one can focus on breathing, relax the mind, and reduce stress levels.\n##\n3. **Mindfulness, Concentration, and Reaction Speed Training**  \nHelps users increase mindfulness, concentration, and reaction speed. Regular exercises improve the ability to cope in dynamic situations.\n##\n4. **Game**  \nAn excellent exercise in mindfulness and perceptiveness. The task is to memorize as many characteristic elements of the space as possible, and then correctly answer questions formulated by the therapist, e.g., How many ducks are swimming in the pond? The game includes several levels that differ in: the number of elements and increased amount of audio and motion stimuli.", "short_description": "The Enter the Emotions app is an innovative tool that supports learning to recognize and name emotions through virtual reality. It creates an immersive environment that helps users experience and understand emotions in a controlled, safe way. The app includes animations for analyzing emotions, relaxation exercises and mindfulness training to help develop memory, concentration, attentiveness and self-awareness."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "PDP-PROMO-3000900.png", "id": "4080289242206870", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391784_4080289245540203_1637910289234212728_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NIiLKSqWAPwQ7kNvwFFGPSn&_nc_oc=AdqvmUkBjx_qYuhHCZ5ezE9YcK4jYIvEZjkEZS6WheH1Idtyje8IuxiaLx0KNapCpBU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU5eYgoeP_C5uE3O4V5IcwLC2rZTppv1oo0JvKekLbFyw&oe=6B105859"}, {"file_name": "LOGO-IKONA-TRANS.png", "id": "4051608655084468", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_4051608658417801_4081838733268112048_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fRYlk1KRYEgQ7kNvwH39Jew&_nc_oc=Adrk1vqdsTMCqAZlXcvE_vhyM4QomccgoIeC2CFvHSatnf87RFFCmhxZKxM5XNs1tiA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUiF2Rpz8uw7fGOtzaUc5ddqFqFgD3raC-JcN8FGPzOlA&oe=6B104BAA"}, {"file_name": "TrailerCover-2560-1440.png", "id": "3213993708767466", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391812_3213993712100799_2